<title>USA: McGraw-Hill cuts 340 more jobs.</title>
<headline>McGraw-Hill cuts 340 more jobs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK, N.Y. 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>McGraw-Hill Cos said Thursday it will eliminate about 340 positions with the integration the former Times Mirror Higher Education Group, which it acquired October 16.</p>
<p>McGraw-Hill said the staff reductions will be complete by September 1997.</p>
<p>The company said these 340 psotions represents a second round of job cuts, that follows the elimination of 135 jobs in November.</p>
